          ("Do you make alcove cabinets and shelving?", "Yes. We design alcove units for living rooms, bedrooms, fireplaces and media areas, including cabinets, open shelves, hidden cable storage and matching finishes."),
          ("Can you design utility room or boot room storage?", "Yes. We can plan tall cupboards, bench seating, shoe storage, coat hooks, appliance housings, laundry zones and practical cleaning storage."),
